cot-s7","That was a good one.":"sh-mascot-s8","How big shall we go? Tap a number!":"sh-pick-times-s","You are doing beautifully.":"sh-mascot-u3","You are so clever.":"sh-mascot-u5","What Number? Count the blocks!":"sh-card-b1","Fill the Right Block!":"sh-card-b2","Add and Subtract!":"sh-card-l2","Column Add!":"sh-card-c1","Count By! Count in jumps!":"sh-card-s1","Carry Add! Carry the one!":"sh-card-c2","Take Away! Column style!":"sh-card-c3","Borrow Take Away! Borrow one!":"sh-card-c4","Which is Bigger? Feed the hungry mouth!":"sh-card-g1","What's Missing? Make both sides the same!":"sh-card-b3","You reached Earth!":"sh-arrive-0","Earth is our home planet — the only place we know with oceans, trees and you!":"sh-fact-0","Earth spins all the way round once every day. That is what makes morning and night!":"sh-fact-0-2","Water covers most of the Earth. From space, our planet looks blue!":"sh-fact-0-3","Earth has a blanket of air all around it, and that air is what you breathe.":"sh-fact-0-4","You reached the Moon!":"sh-arrive-1","Footprints on the Moon never blow away, because the Moon has no wind at all!":"sh-fact-1","The Moon has no light of its own. It shines because the Sun shines on it!":"sh-fact-1-2","On the Moon you would weigh much less, so you could jump ever so high!":"sh-fact-1-3","The Moon goes round and round the Earth, like a friend who never leaves.":"sh-fact-1-4","You reached Mars!":"sh-arrive-2","Mars is called the Red Planet, because it is covered in rusty red dust!":"sh-fact-2","Mars has two little moons. They are called Phobos and Deimos!":"sh-fact-2-2","The biggest volcano in the whole solar system is on Mars. Its name is Olympus Mons!":"sh-fact-2-3","Robots from Earth are driving about on Mars, taking photographs of the dust.":"sh-fact-2-4","You reached the Asteroid Belt!":"sh-arrive-3","The asteroid belt is full of giant space rocks, all tumbling around the Sun!":"sh-fact-3","The asteroid belt sits between Mars and Jupiter, like a ring of rubble.":"sh-fact-3-2","The biggest rock in the belt is called Ceres, and it is round like a little planet!":"sh-fact-3-3","The rocks are so far apart that a spaceship flies straight through without bumping one!":"sh-fact-3-4","You reached Jupiter!":"sh-arrive-4","Jupiter is the biggest planet of all — one thousand Earths could fit inside it!":"sh-fact-4","Jupiter has a storm called the Great Red Spot, and it is wider than the whole Earth!":"sh-fact-4-2","Jupiter is not solid like Earth. It is an enormous ball of swirling gas!":"sh-fact-4-3","Jupiter has a crowd of moons going round it — more than ninety of them!":"sh-fact-4-4","You reached Saturn!":"sh-arrive-5","Saturn’s beautiful rings are made of billions of pieces of sparkling ice!":"sh-fact-5","Saturn is so light for its size that it would float in a giant bath of water!":"sh-fact-5-2","A day on Saturn is short. It spins all the way round in about ten hours!":"sh-fact-5-3","Saturn’s biggest moon is called Titan, and it has rivers — but not rivers of water!":"sh-fact-5-4","You reached the Milky Way!":"sh-arrive-6","Our galaxy is called the Milky Way — it has more stars than you could ever count!":"sh-fact-6","Our Sun is just one star in the Milky Way, and there are billions more!":"sh-fact-6-2","From far away, the Milky Way looks like an enormous spinning pinwheel of stars.":"sh-fact-6-3","Earth, the Moon, Mars, Saturn — everywhere you have been today lives inside the Milky Way!":"sh-fact-6-4","Journey complete! You reached the Milky Way!":"sh-arrive-final","A brand new journey begins. Blast off!":"sh-journey-new","Off we go!":"sh-journey-go","What number? Count the blocks!":"sh-l-what-number-count-the-blocks","Tap again for a new one!":"sh-l-tap-again-for-a-new-one","Too many! Take one away.":"sh-l-too-many-take-one-away","Count each side. Tap a row to count ten!":"sh-l-count-each-side-tap-a-row-to-count-ten","The little box holds one, or nothing.":"sh-l-the-little-box-holds-one-or-nothing","Which side has more?":"sh-l-which-side-has-more","The mouth opens towards the bigger number. If they are the same, it keeps its mouth shut.":"sh-l-the-mouth-opens-towards-the-bigger-number-if","You found it!":"sh-l-you-found-it","You built it!":"sh-l-you-built-it","Hop to the answer!":"sh-l-hop-to-the-answer","Tap the answer!":"sh-l-tap-the-answer","Which is bigger?":"sh-l-which-is-bigger","The same!":"sh-l-the-same","Yum!":"sh-l-yum","Just the one you carried.":"sh-l-just-the-one-you-carried","Write the one.":"sh-l-write-the-one","Little box. Did you make a ten?":"sh-l-little-box-did-you-make-a-ten","One for yes. Zero for no.":"sh-l-one-for-yes-zero-for-no","Carry the ten next door!":"sh-l-carry-the-ten-next-door","Type one.":"sh-l-type-one","Nothing to carry.":"sh-l-nothing-to-carry","Type zero.":"sh-l-type-zero","No is one. Yes is zero.":"sh-l-no-is-one-yes-is-zero","Take one from next door.":"sh-l-take-one-from-next-door","You need one from next door.":"sh-l-you-need-one-from-next-door","You do not need one.":"sh-l-you-do-not-need-one","Start with the glowing box.":"sh-l-start-with-the-glowing-box","Carry adding!":"sh-l-carry-adding","Taking away!":"sh-l-taking-away","Borrowing!":"sh-l-borrowing"}}
